      byRoad: "NH 34 connects Rishikesh to Devprayag, Rudraprayag, Sonprayag (for Kedarnath) and Joshimath (for Badrinath). NH 108 connects Uttarkashi to Gangotri. State buses (GMOU/KMOU) run from Rishikesh/Haridwar to all dhams during season. Private taxis: ₹3,500-5,000 per day.",
